Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=29}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:05.02,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Rotten woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:08.40,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you try to make a fool\Nof the great Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:12.65,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Insulting me for having\Nthe blood of a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:15.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, you don't have\Nto do this, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.35,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:40.11,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,Klahadore, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:43.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello, Klahadore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.23,0:02:48.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:50.69,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,Merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!\NWhat happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, wake up! Merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:57.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness. You're\Nstill alive. I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:03.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Merry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:10.50,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,You have to tell me\Nwho did this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:15.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore. That's who.\NHe attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:21.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a... He's a pirate.\NHe's never been anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.81,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,But...\Nhow could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:28.60,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,He got close to you just\Nso he could steal your fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all he's ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.23,0:03:31.94,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:49.33,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,Then... what Usopp spoke\Nabout yesterday was the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:54.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. And that's\Nwhat is most tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:58.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When he learned the truth, he tried\Nhis hardest to get us to hear him out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:00.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but we were all too\Nshallow-minded,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:03.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,too confident in the closed off world\Nwe've lived in for so long
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.77,0:04:06.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to listen to a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:10.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Quick! Run, Kaya!\NThey're gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:13.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise, this'll all make\Nsense tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:19.57,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,In our blind protection\Nof the villain in our midst,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:23.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we drove away the one brave lad\Nwhose desperate resolve
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:27.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}he enacted for the sake and safety\Nof every person of this village,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:29.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,including you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.50,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,Someone!\NAnyone! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:34.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Merry needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:36.71,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,No, miss.\NIt's of no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:41.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The entire staff is on leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:43.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one has been\Nhere since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:45.47,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then I just... I'll find...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:49.89,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,You cannot let\Nyourself get flustered, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:53.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know the attack has\Nyet to begin, so be calm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:57.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and think clearly about what\Nit is you have to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:01.91,Main-207-,Merry,0,0,0,,Because if Klahadore is\Nthe thief we understand him to be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:06.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}and his goal is your fortune and your mansion,\Nthen by all means, let him have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.66,0:05:10.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,None of this is worth\Nsacrificing your life over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:12.96,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:18.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's a cruel truth, but you are the only one\Nwho can stop Klahadore now, Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.22,0:05:21.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:25.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know... this is not...\Nyour burden but still I must ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:29.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.\NAnd I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:32.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't a situation\NI can run away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:35.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know what consequences I face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:38.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will find Klahadore\Nand I will finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:45.20,Main-207-,Pepper,0,0,0,,What? You saw\NKlahadore heading to the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:48.29,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he had\Nthis weird, scary look on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:51.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Carrot, would you wake up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:55.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on. It's way\Ntoo early for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:58.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is no time for laziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:06:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Horrible things\Ncould be happening right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:05.68,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,I still think\Nthe pirates are gonna attack soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:10.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I know our Captain said that was a lie,\Nbut I think he was the one that was lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're probably right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:14.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was weird.\NHe seemed off yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:16.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Captain wasn't\Nhis usual self.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:19.94,Main-207-,Onion,0,0,0,,It's Kaya.\NShe's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:33.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like something's got\Nher really bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, walking around outside\Nby herself doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:40.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something's goin' on.\NSomething really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come forth,\NMeowban Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:53.14,Main-207-,,0,0,13,,Yes, Captain?\NDid you call for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:57.94,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,Siam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:06:58.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And Butchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.28,Main-207-,Both,0,0,0,,Together\Nwe are the Meowban Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:02.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At your service!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:03.99,Main-207-,Both,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:05.95,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Butchie. Siam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:11.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We absolutely must get up this hill, but as\Nyou can plainly see our path is blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you would be so kind\Nas to remove this obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way! {\i1}We{\i0} couldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.59,0:07:21.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He looks too strong.\NRight, Butchie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:23.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, he's strong.\NWay stronger than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.34,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:28.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides we just guard\Nthe ship, not fight people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:32.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're really not the guys\Nyou want to send into battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:35.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, they're\Na couple of pansies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:37.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess they're not\Nthe trump card after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:39.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Siam, just do it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:41.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!\NPlease, not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:42.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:45.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll go. Just stop yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:49.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The guy's crying like a baby.\NWhat are they doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:51.91,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,Of all people, why force
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:53.20,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,– that guy into a fight?\N– I'm gonna tear you up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:55.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with these claws,\Nyou just wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:57.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a vicious killing machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm coming\Nfor you, you bad people!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:03.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You come any closer\Nand I'll cut you in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not joking! I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:14.18,Thoughts-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.02,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:18.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It seems you fell\Nfor my little ruse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed\Nyou blocked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:23.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Considering what a\Nbrilliant performance I gave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:26.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't let the tiny bit\Nof skill you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:28.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,cause you to underestimate\NSiam of the Meowban Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:34.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you missing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:37.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not that I would know\Nanything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cat Burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.25,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Give me my swords back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:48.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you already have a sword,\Nhow greedy can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:53.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye,\Nswords. Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:03.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, I feel lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:07.07,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,You should take care\Nwith other people's things!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:16.91,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,You really have\Nto be faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm agile as a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Butchie, you're up!\NGet in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:28.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Siam!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:30.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cat...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.47,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}'Tastrophe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.27,0:09:40.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn, Butchie.\NHe got away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:43.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, he's right there!\NNow hold him tight this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Careful, he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:47.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stronger than I thought he'd be,\Neven without all his blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:50.61,Thoughts-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,This is getting worse\Nby the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:55.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If Tubby there woulda landed on me,\NI'da been pounded into the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll get him\Nfor sure this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:58.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One-Sword Technique's not\Nmy forte fellas, but what the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:05.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Butchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, Siam! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:09.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pussy Willow March!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:20.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't good. They got\Nhim on the defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:24.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:27.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way that Zoro\Ncan gain any ground
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:30.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if he's too busy blocking\Ntheir attacks. I'm gonna help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:32.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.53,0:10:34.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lead Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:49.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to shoot\Nat the bad guys, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.34,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,But I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:55.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was... It was like he moved\Nin front of my shot on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.89,0:10:57.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:01.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You dumbass. Don't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.23,0:11:12.11,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,It's just a thought, but... Maybe\Nit's the two of us who just got saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:16.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you had actually hit one of those guys,\Nthey would've come after us instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:19.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we wouldn't have a chance\Nof holding up against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All this time\Nhe was worried about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:31.88,Thoughts-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,If I just had one more sword,\NI could take these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:35.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get the swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:38.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I can get them back to Zoro,\Nthere'll be no way he can lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:40.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me get the swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:41.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.85,0:11:43.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can barely even\Nstand up on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.46,0:12:07.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.25,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,What\Ndo you need swords for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:29.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. I'm sorry. I can...\Nexplain all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:37.49,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,The night\Nhas long since passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:42.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So why is it that you seem\Nto have made no progress on the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:44.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain... Kuro... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:46.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll... He'll kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.14,0:13:11.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:20.32,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,To think that these brats\Nhave held you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:22.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How the Black Cat Pirates have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:26.87,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,What have you got\Nto say for yourself? Jango!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:35.09,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,But... Uh...\NWell... I... You said...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:35.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:41.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but... you said letting the kid\Ngo wouldn't cause any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:46.72,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,I did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:47.72,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:49.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's your point?\NHe's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:51.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew no one would listen\Nto his warnings
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:54.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and he would come stumbling back\Nto take a stand against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:14:00.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But the one thing I hadn't taken account\Nfor, was your inexcusable weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:03.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir. We're not weak.\NIt's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.32,0:14:05.99,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,Who are you\Nto call us weak?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:07.66,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,Watch what\Nyou say, Captain Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.71,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,You used\Nto be quite the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:15.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, face it, Kuro,\Nit's been three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and we haven't exactly\Nbeen living the good life
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:19.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,waiting on a rich girl hand and foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:21.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:26.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}For three long years, we've been out\Nsinking pirate ships and massacring villages!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very good. Finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You've done nothing\Nthis whole time! We've been killing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.98,0:14:37.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You butler! There's no way\Nyou can beat the Meowban Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:44.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't! Butchie, Siam, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:52.16,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,You are not\Nour captain anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:55.67,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,So sorry,\Nbut we have to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:16.31,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Who? Who are\Nyou going to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:18.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He snuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:20.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:25.74,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:28.07,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,Ah!\NHe... He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:33.37,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,The... Pussyfoot Maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.21,0:15:40.13,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,You know,\Nyou're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:48.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I do feel... a bit sluggish\Nafter all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:51.81,Thoughts-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,He's handling\Nthem like babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:54.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,And, those two\Nnearly defeated Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:16:00.27,Thoughts-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\q2}With his Pussyfoot Maneuver,\NCaptain Kuro could shred everyone on this beach
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:03.15,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,before we drew\Nour next breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:05.49,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't even see\Nit coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:11.66,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,There is no escape\Nfrom a killing machine like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:15.79,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew he hadn't grown soft\Nwhen I saw that old habit of his,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:20.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,that strange way of lifting his glasses\Nso that he won't cut his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.13,0:16:22.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's like he never stopped\Nwearing those cat claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:24.38,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,They're almost\Na part of his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:27.01,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, he hasn't\Nforgotten how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.14,0:16:38.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're very lucky.\NI'm feeling somewhat merciful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:42.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe these years\Non dry land have made me soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:46.57,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,I'll give\Nyou five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.70,0:16:52.49,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,If you can't deal\Nwith the situation here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:57.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in five minutes, then I'll kill\Nevery last one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, have I made\Nmyself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:08.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:11.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course,\Nthat's perfectly clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:13.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being\Nso forgiving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:17.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is take care\Nof this one guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:20.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Five minutes will be more\Nthan enough time for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:30.61,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,We nearly had him\Na few minutes ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:33.45,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,We won't need one minute\Nto finish him this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:37.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!\NKill him! Kill him, dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:38.70,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:43.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:47.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:51.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Easy there! You can't just kick\N'em! Those're my swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:53.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How 'bout a "thanks"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:56.47,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:58.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha. I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:03.77,Main-207-,Siam,0,0,0,,You idiot! It won't matter\Nhow many swords you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:06.27,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,Now you'll die\Nholding three of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:08.36,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:13.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You still... don't... get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:16.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:22.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The clock is ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.42,0:18:30.21,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Carrying three swords\Nwon't help you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:32.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unless, you know\NThree-Swords Style.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:43.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:19:01.54,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,{\q2}He took down\Nthe Meowban Brothers with one attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:16.09,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:21.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I can promise you. Everything will be\Ntaken care of... in less than five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:38.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three. Three minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:42.08,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:46.50,Main-207-,Butchie,0,0,0,,I'll...\NI'll slaughter him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:51.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please... Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:55.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can do it... Hypnotize me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:20:00.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just... do it... Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.\NYou do sloppy work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:05.60,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all that blubber\Nprotected his vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:32.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Butchie! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:39.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Really?\NYou back for more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:44.97,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,This guy\Nmeans business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:48.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was trouble\Nwhen he was half this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:53.57,Main-207-,Zoro,0,0,0,,Then Jango had\Nto flip his psycho switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.16,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:07.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta wake that lazy jerk up\Nwhile I still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:10.25,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,What is\Nthat girl up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:13.42,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Something tricky I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:16.63,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,Everyone else is busy fighting\Nfor their lives and he's just sleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:24.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get up! You bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.77,0:21:32.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was\Nnice knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.15,0:21:35.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dodge it! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.07,0:21:39.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:44.24,Thoughts-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,I thought it was just a hypnotic\Ncharm, but it's also his weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:49.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! You can not just go\Naround stepping on people's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! How is that twerp\Nstill alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.79,0:21:59.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's either the best timing,\Nor the worst timing in the world. I can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.93,0:22:04.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh. Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:11.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.98,0:22:17.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Owww!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.15,0:22:19.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap! That guy's back\Nin the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:21.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:24.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Five minutes'll never\Nbe enough time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:28.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh! That hurts, you jerk!\NWhy'd you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:30.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, sleeping beauty,\Nthat wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.16,0:22:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It wasn't... me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:38.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You okay? Nami, did\Nyou get hurt? Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.96,0:22:42.38,Main-207-,Nami,0,0,0,,Oh, it's\Nnothing. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:45.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've done everything\NI can for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:51.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, we have to win. We\Ncan't afford to lose this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:53.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.35,0:22:58.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay. Go. Win this\Nand protect my treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.52,0:23:01.32,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah,\Nthe treasure, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:05.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One minute. And counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kuro can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:12.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly finish\Nthem in one minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:15.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, guys, stop messing\Naround and end this already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.22,0:23:29.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Butchie! Quickly! There's\Nno more time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:32.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kill that three sword bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:36.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take care\Nof the freaky, bendable kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:45.32,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,I'm coming\Nfor you, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.16,0:23:50.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? Hey, wait. Why\Nis that shady butler here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:55.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's that kid. Didn't\Nhe die falling off a cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.96,0:23:58.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.97,0:24:10.97,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.97,0:24:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't ever sneak up on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:18.48,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Unless you\Nwant to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:20.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.75,0:24:38.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Usopp. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.00,0:24:41.67,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Kaya...\Nwhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.38,0:24:44.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Usopp. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.46,0:24:47.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how\Nyou'll ever forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.47,0:24:53.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I just couldn't believe it... that Klahadore\Nis a scheming, murdering pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:54.72,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.72,0:24:56.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.52,0:24:58.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya, your life is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.69,0:25:00.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you to run\Nsomewhere safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.44,0:25:04.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't! You're still here\Nfighting! I won't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.07,0:25:09.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fought for me\Nafter I treated you so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.49,0:25:12.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at you, you're barely\Nalive, but you're still so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.78,0:25:13.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.58,0:25:16.04,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,This is\Nno place for a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.04,0:25:18.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Madam, please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.37,0:25:24.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please. Stop. Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.30,0:25:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop this right\Nnow, Klahadore!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.39,0:25:37.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.72,0:25:40.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Merry already told me\Nabout everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.02,0:25:45.36,Main-207-,Jango,0,0,0,,Hm? What's the girl\Nfrom the mansion doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.36,0:25:48.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The whole reason that we're here\Nis to murder that little rich girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.94,0:25:51.91,Main-207-,Pirate G,0,0,0,,If she's here, then\Nwe don't have to go to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.91,0:25:54.41,Main-207-,Pirate I,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is\Nkill her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.79,0:25:58.54,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,Klahadore, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.54,0:26:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want my fortune,\Nyou can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.00,0:26:03.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take it all and leave this village\Nright now I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:07.92,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,I will gladly accept\Nyour fortune, Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.92,0:26:09.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.92,0:26:11.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.97,0:26:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, simply acquiring\Nwealth isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:20.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,More than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.52,0:26:23.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What I want... is peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.19,0:26:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.40,0:26:27.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. Just peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.07,0:26:30.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peace of mind.\NIt's simple really.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.07,0:26:35.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have spent the last three years\Nearning the trust of the entire village,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.07,0:26:40.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(4859,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)\q2}and, to be honest, I find this new sense\Nof peace and tranquility quite comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.79,0:26:46.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When my plan comes to fruition, I will\Nlive with this sublime peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.01,0:27:02.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The glorious comfort of a peaceful life\Nwill be mine for forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.81,0:27:05.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In short, these pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.77,0:27:13.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you... will leave\Nyour fortune to me and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.28,0:27:16.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya, these things\Nwill happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.99,0:27:20.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.20,0:27:22.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.79,0:27:26.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run away, Kaya! There's\Nno use talking to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.21,0:27:29.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.17,0:27:31.25,Main-207-,Kaya,0,0,0,,You're not Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.25,0:27:33.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! You're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.99,0:27:35.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.63,0:27:39.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leave here, right now!\NNever come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.80,0:27:43.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. I see. You're\Nall grown up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.27,0:27:46.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So much has happened\Nin the last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.77,0:27:49.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Kaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.40,0:27:52.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember\Nthe things we went through?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.53,0:27:56.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We spent so much time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.24,0:28:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even before your dear sweet\Nparents passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.66,0:28:05.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were more than my master,\Nyou were my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.04,0:28:06.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.25,0:28:11.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So many memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.59,0:28:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Together we suffered\Nand together we rejoiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.76,0:28:16.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.80,0:28:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Klahadore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.30,0:28:23.06,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,I took you\Non shopping trips to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:26.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I looked after you so diligently\Nwhen you were ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we used to talk\Nfor hours and hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.90,0:28:36.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kaya, listen to me.\NI was devoted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.69,0:28:39.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.28,0:28:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For so very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:45.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I endured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.54,0:28:49.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I quietly suffered so that today\NI could end your life
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.62,0:28:53.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and take everything\Nthat I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.38,0:29:05.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I, who was once the feared and respected Captain Kuro,\Nhad to bow and humble myself
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.64,0:29:08.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before some snot-nosed little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.39,0:29:12.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It went against every fiber of my being.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.44,0:29:19.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.61,0:29:22.99,Main-207-,Kuro,0,0,0,,Can you understand\Nthe depth of these daily insults?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.91,0:29:28.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Can you understand the rage created\Nby those transgressions against my pride?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.50,0:29:39.13,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Kuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.80,0:29:47.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you for reminding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.43,0:29:51.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I owe\Nyou for hitting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.56,0:29:52.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's get even.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.40,0:29:55.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.06,0:29:59.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I recall, you hit me as\Nhard as you could, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.69,0:30:00.70,Main-207-,Usopp,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.09,0:30:27.93,Main-207-,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\q2}If he hates getting hit that much,\Nhe's about to have a really bad day!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=30}===============================DIALOGUE============================
